# CTT: Telit LE910Q1-WWG (vid:pid 1bc7:7020) USB interface minimization — RNDIS data path.
#
# The modem advertises 8 USB interfaces by default:
#   0 - RNDIS control   (with iface 1, creates the RNDIS net device — renamed to mdm0 by 78-ctt-telit-net.rules)
#   1 - RNDIS data
#   2 - CDC ACM control (ttyACM, ModemManager AT port)
#   3 - CDC ACM data partner for iface 2
#   4 - CDC ACM control (MM rejects as "unhandled serial type", unused)
#   5 - CDC ACM data partner for the unused port
#   6 - CDC ACM control (second ACM AT port)
#   7 - CDC ACM data partner for iface 6
#
# RNDIS data path: leave 0+1 AUTHORIZED so rndis_host binds and the RNDIS
# net interface comes up (renamed to mdm0). Keep 2+3 and 6+7 for
# ModemManager AT access (signal / registration / operator), which works on
# the RNDIS path too — over the AT port, independent of the bearer.
# Deauthorize only 4+5 (the ACM pair MM can't use) to trim unused USB
# endpoints (each active endpoint adds dwc_otg FIQ scheduling pressure on the
# CM3 — a contributor to FunCube NYET errors on V3).
#
# NOTE: this rule previously also deauthorized 0+1 to force the PPP-only
# path. RNDIS needs them, so those two lines are removed. (Blocking 6+7 as a
# further FunCube-bandwidth trim is viable on RNDIS — pppd no longer holds
# ttyACM4 — but is deferred until the RNDIS path is verified, to avoid
# disturbing MM's AT access in the same change.)
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1bc7", ATTRS{idProduct}=="7020", ATTR{bInterfaceNumber}=="04", ATTR{authorized}="0"
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1bc7", ATTRS{idProduct}=="7020", ATTR{bInterfaceNumber}=="05", ATTR{authorized}="0"
# 06/07 also blocked: on RNDIS the second ACM/AT pair is unused (pppd no
# longer holds ttyACM4; MM runs on 02/03 alone). Frees 2 USB endpoints to
# reduce dwc_otg pressure with 4 FunCubes. Net active = 4 ifaces (00/01+02/03),
# same footprint as the old PPP config.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1bc7", ATTRS{idProduct}=="7020", ATTR{bInterfaceNumber}=="06", ATTR{authorized}="0"
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1bc7", ATTRS{idProduct}=="7020", ATTR{bInterfaceNumber}=="07", ATTR{authorized}="0"
